  <!--EN: Prevent deletion of children of colonists-->
  <PreventChildPurge>防止删除殖民者的孩子</PreventChildPurge>
  <!--EN: What is the point of Repopulationism if your children instantly get autodeleted by Rimworlds overly aggressive Garbage Collection?-->
  <PreventChildPurge_desc>如果你的孩子会被《Rimworlds》过于激进的垃圾回收机制立即自动删除，那么人口再造主义还有什么意义呢？</PreventChildPurge_desc>
  <!--EN: Prevent deletion of fathers relevant to Repopulationism (Necessary if using Repopulationism)-->
  <PreventFatherPurge>防止删除与人口再造相关的父亲（如果使用人口再造，则必须执行此操作）</PreventFatherPurge>
  <!--EN: This setting is important for Repopulationism to work properly. The aggressive culling of World-Pawns of 1.6 sometimes deletes fathers before children are born and before they can come to pick up their children.-->
  <PreventFatherPurge_desc>此设置对于人口重建机制的正常运作至关重要。1.6 版本中对世界棋子的激进清除有时会在孩子出生前、父亲来接孩子之前就将他们抹杀掉。</PreventFatherPurge_desc>
  <!--EN: Attempt to prevent deletion of those selected above by other mods suchs as BetterGC (Dangerous / Needs restart)-->
  <PreventPurgeEvenMore>尝试防止其他模组（如 BetterGC）删除上述选定的棋子（危险 / 需要重启）</PreventPurgeEvenMore>
  <!--EN: Do not turn this on unless needed. Some WorldPawn cleaning mods skip the vanilla validiation of WorldPawns and straight up go to deletion, yet still use the vanilla method to delete them. Enabling this setting will patch that vanilla method in hopes of preserving your friends. Personally I'd recommend disabling those other mods, as vanilla Rimworld 1.6 is already aggressive enough on its own when purging WorldPawns. Toggling needs a restart to take effact.-->
  <PreventPurgeEvenMore_desc>除非必要，否则请勿启用此功能。某些世界角色清理模组会跳过原版游戏对世界角色的验证，直接删除它们，但仍然使用原版游戏的删除方法。启用此设置将修复原版游戏的删除方法，以期保留您的好友。我个人建议禁用这些其他模组，因为原版 Rimworld 1.6 在清理世界角色时已经足够彻底了。切换设置需要重启游戏才能生效。</PreventPurgeEvenMore_desc>
  <!--EN: Prevent deletion of any relatives of colonists (Dangerous)-->
  <PreventRelativePurge>阻止移除殖民者亲友关系</PreventRelativePurge>
  <!--EN: Do not turn this setting on unless you are using a mod like "No random relatives" that prevents relatives from being generated to avoid massive bloat of world pawns-->
  <PreventRelativePurge_desc>此设置对人口复兴观念的运行十分重要，1.6版本对于殖民地外的小人的自动清除有时会在孩子出生前就删除其生父及其他亲属</PreventRelativePurge_desc>
